          <h1 class="hero-title">Dharun Kumar S</h1>

          <div class="hero-subtitle" aria-label="Role">
            I am a <span id="typewriter" class="typewriter-text"></span><span class="typewriter-cursor" aria-hidden="true">|</span>
          </div>

          <p class="hero-subtext">
            Full-stack developer building scalable web applications, data-driven platforms, and cloud solutions.
            Integrating rigorous quality engineering from two years at Hyundai Motor India with modern web and AI innovation.
