    <!-- ===== ABOUT ME ===== -->
    <section class="section scroll-reveal" id="about">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title-wrapper">
          <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
          <div class="section-line"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="about-content">
            <p class="about-para lead-text">
              I started on the shop floor — two years as an Assembly Shop Technician at Hyundai Motor India, where every vehicle had to pass the same standard, every time. That discipline — checklists, root-cause fixes, zero tolerance for "close enough" — is the same discipline I now bring to code.
            </p>
            <p class="about-para">
              I'm currently pursuing my B.Tech in Information Technology at K. Ramakrishnan College of Engineering (2023–2027), after an earlier Diploma in Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering. In between, I've been teaching myself web development, databases, and cloud fundamentals — and shipping real projects instead of just tutorials.
            </p>
            <p class="about-para">
              Right now I'm building <span class="highlight-blue">Manganikka</span>, an enterprise-grade creator portfolio &amp; media kit site for a Dubai-based Tamil YouTube creator, on Next.js and TypeScript — my first production-style client build.
            </p>
          </div>

          <aside class="quick-facts-card card" aria-label="Quick facts about Dharun">
            <div class="facts-header">
              <h3>Quick Facts</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="facts-body">
              <div class="fact-row">
                <span class="fact-label">Location</span>
                <span class="fact-value">Trichy, Tamil Nadu, IN</span>
              </div>
              <div class="fact-row">
                <span class="fact-label">Education</span>
                <span class="fact-value">B.Tech IT — Expected 2027</span>
              </div>
              <div class="fact-row">
                <span class="fact-label">Prior Role</span>
                <span class="fact-value">Assembly Tech, Hyundai</span>
              </div>
              <div class="fact-row">
                <span class="fact-label">Target Roles</span>
                <span class="fact-value">Software / Web / Java</span>
              </div>
              <div class="fact-row">
                <span class="fact-label">Languages</span>
                <span class="fact-value">Tamil (Native), English (Prof)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="fact-row">
                <span class="fact-label">Status</span>
                <span class="fact-value status-available">
                  <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
                  Available
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

